; Title: Dow Cave (part thereof)

; created 27/10/2015 by Patrick Warren (PBW) from an original by Steve Warren

; Currently only includes main stream passage as far as Hobson's Choice

*begin DowCave
*export dow1.1
*export dow2.31

; Dow Cave entrance at SD 98378 74300, alitude 334m ODN.
; Corresponds to 1:10k OS map on Magic Map.  Origin of altitude
; uncertain at moment.

*entrance dow1.1
*fix dow1.1 98378 74300 334

*include dow1
*include dow2

*equate dow1.27 dow2.27

*end DowCave
